{"compound":{"cid":5280383,"queryId":"C00909","title":"Leukotriene A4","formula":"C20H30O3","molecularWeight":"318.4","iupacName":"4-[(2S,3S)-3-[(1E,3E,5Z,8Z)-tetradeca-1,3,5,8-tetraenyl]oxiran-2-yl]butanoic acid","inchiKey":"UFPQIRYSPUYQHK-WAQVJNLQSA-N","description":{"text":"Leukotriene A4 is a leukotriene that is the (5S,6S)-epoxy derivative of (7E,9E,11Z,14Z)-icosa-7,9,11,14-tetraenoic acid. It has a role as a mouse metabolite, a plant metabolite and a human metabolite. It is a long-chain fatty acid, a leukotriene, a polyunsaturated fatty acid, an oxylipin and an epoxy fatty acid. It is functionally related to an icosa-7,9,11,14-tetraenoic acid. It is a conjugate acid of a leukotriene A4(1-).","source":"ChEBI"},"synonyms":["Leukotriene A4","LTA4","Leukotriene A","72059-45-1","5S,6S-epoxy-7E,9E,11Z,14Z-eicosatetraenoic acid","7Y7MPZ6563","CHEBI:15651","DTXSID40903945","(5S,6S,7E,9E,11Z,14Z)-5,6-Epoxyicosa-7,9,11,14-tetraenoate","(7E,9E,11Z,14Z)-(5S,6S)-5,6-Epoxyeicosa-7,9,11,14-tetraenoic acid","(7E,9E,11Z,14Z)-(5S,6S)-5,6-Epoxyicosa-7,9,11,14-tetraenoate","4-[(2S,3S)-3-[(1E,3E,5Z,8Z)-tetradeca-1,3,5,8-tetraen-1-yl]oxiran-2-yl]butanoic acid","Oxiranebutanoic acid, 3-(1,3,5,8-tetradecatetraenyl)-, (2S-(2alpha,3beta(1E,3Z,5Z,8Z)))-","Leukotrienes A","Leukotriene A 4","Leukotriene A-4","4-[(2S,3S)-3-[(1E,3E,5Z,8Z)-tetradeca-1,3,5,8-tetraenyl]oxiran-2-yl]butanoic acid","4-{(2S,3S)-3-[(1E,3E,5Z,8Z)-tetradeca-1,3,5,8-tetraen-1-yl]oxiran-2-yl}butanoic acid","4-((2S,3S)-3-((1E,3E,5Z,8Z)-tetradeca-1,3,5,8-tetraen-1-yl)oxiran-2-yl)butanoic acid","4-((2S,3S)-3-((1E,3E,5Z,8Z)-tetradeca-1,3,5,8-tetraenyl)oxiran-2-yl)butanoic acid","RefChem:153147","DTXCID501331893","CHEMBL69439","(7E,9E,11Z,14Z)-(5S,6S)-5,6-Epoxyeicosa-7,9,11,14-tetraenoate","(5S,6S,7E,9E,11Z,14Z)-5,6-epoxyicosa-7,9,11,14-tetraenoic acid","UNII-7Y7MPZ6563","5S,6S-leukotriene A4","LEUKOTRIENE A4 [MI]","SCHEMBL247614","GTPL5214","BDBM24200","UFPQIRYSPUYQHK-WAQVJNLQSA-N","LMFA03020023","C00909","5S,6S-epoxy-7E,9